TestResults/

# orchestrator task-pipeline artifacts stay out of the repo
/.orchestrator/

# Nothing Quality Studio generates is versioned any more. Ledgers, run reports and
# review sidecars used to be committed here; they made this checkout - which is also
# the integration checkout of the QS project - permanently dirty, and Agent Studio
# refuses to fast-forward a dirty tree. Generated data now lives in the per-project
# data root outside the checkout; see docs/data-root.md for the contract and for how
# to export an artefact deliberately when one is meant to be shared.
#
# Everything below .quality is ignored and the author-owned inputs are then named back
# in. A directory has to be re-included before the files in it can be: Git does not
# descend into an excluded directory, so each input needs both its folder and its
# contents. A nested <folder>/.quality only ever held generated sidecars, so it is
# ignored whole.
/.quality/**
!/.quality/scope.json
!/.quality/inputs/
!/.quality/inputs/**
!/.quality/rules/
!/.quality/rules/**
!/.quality/security/
!/.quality/security/**
!/.quality/attacks/
!/.quality/attacks/catalogue.json
*/**/.quality/
/.dev-stack.log

# Python bytecode from the CI scripts
__pycache__/
*.pyc
